  id: addHominem
  title: Add Hominem
  author: Infusion
  description: "I don't care if you've been studying because you're going to \nbe
    wrong anyway.\n\nQuickly respond to each of the prompts while avoiding previous
    ones, taking note of the values and positions of each correct answer to determine
    the correct passcode.\n\nThis module was released as a manual challenge.\n\nModeling
    originally by Speakingevil.\n\nManual can be found at ktane.timwi.de or in the
    bundled manuals folder.\nSource code is at https://github.com/Infusion478/add-hominem\n\nComes
    with Twitch Plays support."
